<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title>IRC channel logs</title><style>html {
  background: #fdfdfd;
}

h1 {
  font-weight: 300;
}

h2 {
  font-weight: 200;
}

h3 {
  padding: .5em 0;
  border-top: 3px dotted #ddd;
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

form {
  width: 400px;
  display: flex;
}

input {
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  border-radius: .25em 0 0 .25em;
  border: 1px solid #aaa;
  border-right: 0;
  padding: 0.5em;
}

button {
  display: flex;
  border-radius: 0 .25em .25em 0;
  background-color: #007bff;
  border: 1px solid #007bff;
  padding: .5em;
  cursor: pointer;
  color: white;
}

button:hover {
  background-color: #0069d9;
  border-color: #0062cc;
}

a {
  color: #007bff;
  text-decoration: none;
}

a:hover {
  text-decoration: underline;
}

h4 {
  margin-bottom: .5em;
}

table td {
  padding: 0.75em;
}

table tr:hover {
  background: #eee;
}

.year {
  display: table;
}

.month {
  display: table-cell;
  padding-right: 1em;
}

ul {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
}

.nick {
  padding-right: 0.6rem;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-align: right;
  width: 13rem;
  display: table-cell;
}

.nick a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.message {
  display: table-cell;
  padding-left: 0.6rem;
  border-left: 2px solid #333;
}

.notice {
  color: #859900;
  font-style: italic;
}

.line {
  line-height: 1.8rem;
  display: table;
}

#logs {
  margin-top: 1.5rem;
  padding: 1.5rem;
}
</style></head><body><h1>IRC channel logs</h1><h2>2024-12-27.log</h2><p><a href="/bootstrappable">back to list of logs</a></p><div id="logs"><div class="line" id="003229"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#003229" label="[00:32:29]">&lt;fossy&gt;</a></span><span class="message">Googulator: no, <a rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/fosslinux/live-bootstrap/pull/484">https://github.com/fosslinux/live-bootstrap/pull/484</a>  i closed the PR because it wasn't helpful at the time, but I could readd the functionality - the functionality worked</span></div><div class="line" id="003238"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#003238" label="[00:32:38]">&lt;fossy&gt;</a></span><span class="message">stikonas what do you think?</span></div><div class="line" id="003307"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#003307" label="[00:33:07]">&lt;fossy&gt;</a></span><span class="message"> <a rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/fosslinux/live-bootstrap/pull/489:">https://github.com/fosslinux/live-bootstrap/pull/489:</a>  any more comments on this?</span></div><div class="line" id="223455"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#223455" label="[22:34:55]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">fossy, Googulator: yes, we can  readd optional builds in LB</span></div><div class="line" id="223523"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#223523" label="[22:35:23]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">(sorry, I am not that much online these days until the beginning of the next year)</span></div><div class="line" id="223627"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#223627" label="[22:36:27]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">fossy: if possible, I would like to review #489 it a bit more</span></div><div class="line" id="223634"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#223634" label="[22:36:34]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">but I probably won't have time this year</span></div><div class="line" id="223642"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#223642" label="[22:36:42]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">so if you want to merge it, ask Googulator for  comments</span></div><div class="line" id="223803"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#223803" label="[22:38:03]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">one thing I didn't 100% like (though it's not a dealbreaker) is that most patches everywhere are applied with -p1 cause that's what you get out of tools such as &quot;git diff&quot;, etc...</span></div><div class="line" id="223814"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#223814" label="[22:38:14]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">so we always need to tweak them when adding to live-bootstrap</span></div><div class="line" id="223827"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#223827" label="[22:38:27]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">but oh well, it's not the end of the world</span></div><br /></div></body></html>